OL,3,CThree charged with attempted murder in
OL,4,CWorkington
OL,6,FCumbria Police have launched an
OL,7,Finvestigation into an assault in
OL,8,FWorkington, where three people have
OL,9,Fbeen charged with attempted murder.
OL,11,FAndrew Potts, 44, of St Andrews
OL,12,FCrescent, Whitehaven and Antony Gunn,
OL,13,F40 and Melissa Howlett, 35 both of no
OL,14,Ffixed address will appear at
OL,15,FWorkington Magistrates' Court today
OL,16,F(31 July).
