OL,3,CThree charged with attempted murder in
OL,4,CWorkington
OL,6,FThe three individuals have been
OL,7,Fcharged in connection with an assault
OL,8,Fin Peter Street on Wednesday (29 July)
OL,9,Fwhere force says a victim sustained
OL,10,Fsuspected stab wounds.
OL,12,FCumbria Police said: "The victim, a
OL,13,Fman aged in his 30s, remains in
OL,14,Fhospital receiving treatment for
OL,15,Fserious injuries.
OL,17,F"Detectives are continuing their
OL,18,Fappeal for witnesses or anyone who saw
OL,19,Fanything suspicious."
